==Battleground==
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nyalladin (Enemy)|Nyalladin]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**15 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]], [[Fortune Teller Cat (Rare Cat)|Doctor Cat]] and [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necromancer Cat]] with any Research Up [[Cat Combo]] and a Cat capable of Area DPS (such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]) and you'll win easily.

